---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
// Centered "statement" moment — the signature default.com rhythm. Big air around it.
// <!-- TODO: review copy -->
---

<Section class="py-28 text-center md:py-40">
    <div class="reveal">
        <h2
            class="mx-auto max-w-[20ch] text-balance font-serif text-2xl font-medium leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.015em] md:text-5xl"
        >
            I like owning it end-to-end.
        </h2>
        <p
            class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[600px] text-pretty text-base leading-[1.6] text-muted-foreground md:text-lg"
        >
            The architecture, the hiring, even the sales calls. I'd rather have
            my hands on all of it than hand it off. Taking a product from an
            empty repo to Fortune 500 customers is the part I actually enjoy.
        </p>
    </div>
</Section>
